exports[`git.commit.sponsor.sh given: [case9] --who @self reads this machine's git config, and only that when: [t1] git config user.email is unset then: refuses, names the absent half and its fix 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.commit.sponsor set
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: --who @self found no git identity on this machine

   this machine's git config holds no complete identity:
